{"lines":[{"h":0.016289041346850053,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.085401417255840592,"y":0.043454316377061653,"w":0.12045930226643879,"c":1},{"x":0.085278585039993207,"w":0.72462743123372397,"t":"the designs for the layout of the development, with the majority of people saying it generally","y":0.086782268028556486,"h":0.022228554698908498,"c":1},{"x":0.087234018079310735,"t":"made a good impression and blended in well with the natural features of the landscape, with","y":0.10407820156654268,"h":0.02000446260161115,"c":1,"w":0.72846247355143223},{"h":0.019954044425227524,"c":1,"x":0.087240159655273902,"y":0.11964305510754702,"w":0.74200174967447918,"t":"provision made for protecting trees and wildlife on the site. Some people have mentioned that"},{"t":"they'd like to see more facilities for cyclists, and we'll look at that, but the overall feedback","w":0.70904154459635416,"y":0.13658092862654536,"h":0.020607455720039858,"x":0.087235563504999433,"c":1},{"w":0.6915352376302083,"t":"has been that the design and facilities of the development make it seem a place where.","h":0.02086712370780397,"y":0.15225411502158814,"c":1,"x":0.08719567780619504},{"h":0.017703874534535702,"c":1,"x":0.087199938522732057,"t":"people of all ages can live together happily.","w":0.34400871276855466,"y":0.17222348645336671},{"t":"OK. So I'Il put a map of the proposed development up on the screen. You'll see it's bounded","h":0.019831207608136836,"x":0.091110887198307178,"y":0.21493901127440873,"w":0.72264124552408859,"c":1},{"t":"on the south side by the main road, which then goes on to Nunston. Another boundary is","y":0.23101878457982838,"w":0.70136144002278644,"x":0.087193315516398875,"h":0.023142842563141919,"c":1},{"t":"formed by London Road, on the western side of the development. Inside the development","x":0.087230520662560027,"y":0.24845440053979395,"w":0.71293874104817712,"h":0.020573979077680882,"c":1},{"h":0.01468702417296408,"w":0.42524271647135409,"c":1,"y":0.26728971969912296,"x":0.087378641837470974,"t":"there'l be about 400 houses and 3 apartment blocks."},{"c":1,"y":0.28842178801673324,"t":"There'll also be a school for children up to 11 years old. If you look at the South Entrance at","w":0.72457178751627604,"h":0.020869208124939087,"x":0.089172512553638325},{"x":0.089131183363008501,"y":0.30320859876229356,"w":0.73233759562174483,"h":0.022681472160363092,"c":1,"t":"the bottom of the map, there's a road from there that goes right up through the development."},{"y":0.32226238951321773,"t":"The school will be on that road, at the corner of the second turning to the left.","w":0.60985224405924487,"h":0.017347640040507484,"c":1,"x":0.089235914296917726},{"x":0.089165115301098302,"w":0.68574859619140627,"h":0.020092654599578874,"c":1,"y":0.34465193523588356,"t":"A large sports centre is planned with facilities for indoor and outdoor activities. This will"},{"w":0.6779436747233073,"h":0.018737757317373593,"x":0.089178302549919222,"c":1,"t":"be on the western side of the development, just below the road that branches off from","y":0.36156531779823919},{"y":0.38224299063341716,"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"London Road.","w":0.11844660441080729,"x":0.089320387156593573,"c":1},{"x":0.091139843740471252,"y":0.40177868634978764,"w":0.70703496297200519,"c":1,"h":0.019944758430076925,"t":"There'll be a clinic where residents can go if they have any health problems. Can you see"},{"w":0.72640040079752599,"y":0.41815880216929502,"x":0.08922981422155829,"t":"the lake towards the top of the map? The clinic will be just below this, to the right of a street","h":0.019076795370036592,"c":1},{"x":0.089211549368281906,"t":"of houses.","y":0.43934528777466086,"w":0.087703825632731131,"h":0.013600404685902845,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.020274735685449463,"y":0.45788609321484641,"t":"There'll also be a community centre for people of all ages. On the northeast side of the","w":0.68954940795898434,"x":0.09111499461001045},{"y":0.47375095207550499,"x":0.091137100439364835,"c":1,"t":"development, there'll be a row of specially designed houses specifically for residents over 65,","w":0.74000050862630207,"h":0.019370919818818777},{"h":0.016568041293420488,"y":0.49364499169160792,"c":1,"x":0.091165403217778523,"w":0.37686826070149737,"t":"and the community centre will be adjoining this."},{"t":"We haven't forgotten about shopping. There'll be a supermarket between the two entrances","c":1,"w":0.7245989990234375,"y":0.51455101594868624,"h":0.021285620953806483,"x":0.091095051984226627},{"y":0.5303464626355191,"w":0.73632303873697924,"c":1,"t":"to the development. We're planning to leave the three large trees near London Road, and it'll","h":0.021780340842368795,"x":0.089127997593834885},{"t":"be just to the south of these.","y":0.5523255816474425,"c":1,"h":0.014652611681976735,"x":0.091262140356888899,"w":0.22912620544433593},{"t":"It's planned to have a playground for younger children. If you look at the road that goes up","x":0.091073084129265569,"h":0.023450203773759948,"c":1,"w":0.71304209391276041,"y":0.57089286500380632},{"w":0.7226493326822917,"t":"from the South Entrance, you'll see it curves round to the left at the top, and the playground","x":0.091106546671039915,"y":0.58792674314341475,"h":0.019612575542889754,"c":1},{"w":0.37888168334960948,"c":1,"t":"will be in that curve, with nice views of the lake.","x":0.091109763677383687,"h":0.017652417714722035,"y":0.60700381851747598},{"t":"OK, so now does anyone ...","w":0.21941747029622394,"h":0.01315746604467849,"c":1,"x":0.095145632821879197,"y":0.63364485956016614},{"w":0.10485436757405597,"y":0.69186046497343245,"x":0.095145631639077716,"h":0.017485329220970791,"t":"PART 3","c":1},{"h":0.018907546997070312,"y":0.71868054591337038,"w":0.60416458129882811,"t":"So, Michelle, shall we make a start on our presentation? We haven't got that","x":0.19211707364194505,"c":1},{"x":0.19029126238298721,"t":"much time left.","c":1,"h":0.013133920093191698,"y":0.73982558129648579,"w":0.12038834889729816},{"w":0.61578287760416672,"h":0.019250583351586803,"c":1,"y":0.7513255310970669,"t":"No, Adam. But at least we've done all the background reading. I found it really","x":0.19213775622348672},{"x":0.18820729994750424,"y":0.76805233580826326,"w":0.52257659912109378,"h":0.018855609477866131,"c":1,"t":"interesting - I'd never even heard of the Laki eruption before this."},{"t":"Me neither. I suppose 1783 is a long time ago.","y":0.78515438617692312,"w":0.36719833374023436,"x":0.19210990880621751,"h":0.016579214434757406,"c":1},{"x":0.19213777343833063,"h":0.018067539963766754,"t":"But it was a huge eruption and it had such devastating consequences.","y":0.79971852159673307,"w":0.55746907552083336,"c":1},{"w":0.64305791219075514,"c":1,"x":0.19012174700807521,"t":"I know. It was great there were so many primary sources to look at. It really gives","y":0.81584037550260613,"h":0.02096645081897397},{"w":0.61779388427734372,"t":"you a sense of how catastrophic the volcano was. People were really trying to","y":0.83175082806617162,"c":1,"x":0.19011723702559966,"h":0.02007215505819826},{"w":0.34563107808430982,"t":"make sense of the science for the first time.","h":0.013112185825811418,"x":0.1941747521608039,"y":0.85171339564621829,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"That's right. But what I found more significant was how it impacted directly and","x":0.19209866993663618,"h":0.018378058103757478,"y":0.86445226917713536,"w":0.62162989298502613},{"c":1,"x":0.19018132191754697,"y":0.88151749247161471,"t":"indirectly on political events, as well as having massive social and economic","w":0.60604522705078123,"h":0.017499991443669649},{"c":1,"x":0.19223301312699595,"w":0.12427183787027993,"t":"consequences.","y":0.90261627896069463,"h":0.013081395514657479},{"t":"106","x":0.097087379253543993,"y":0.96075581421474276,"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"y":0.10319767431389215,"c":1,"t":"Q13\/14","w":0.064077669779459612,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.85048543686107925},{"c":1,"t":"Q13\/14","y":0.15121070869896436,"w":0.064545180002848257,"h":0.014015848985713619,"x":0.85023990408332473},{"x":0.85139589933694271,"y":0.30312927495498976,"h":0.015945623522606978,"t":"Q15","c":1,"w":0.04090894699096681},{"c":1,"y":0.34447674406679907,"x":0.85242718503249193,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q16","w":0.038834950129191137},{"c":1,"t":"Q17","x":0.85436893265699609,"y":0.41715116267145036,"h":0.01308139551465759,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"c":1,"y":0.45784883709005486,"t":"Q18","w":0.036893202463785801,"x":0.85436893265699609,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"c":1,"w":0.036893202463785801,"y":0.51453488359714072,"t":"Q19","x":0.85436893265767022,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"y":0.56976744212409436,"w":0.038834950129191026,"c":1,"x":0.85631068017812295,"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"Q20"},{"t":"Q21","y":0.86337209328183839,"x":0.85825242775093846,"h":0.014534883112922281,"w":0.038834950129191026,"c":1}],"w":2400,"h":3209}